msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He opens the door, heading the four-man procession out of the tower, as he had in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫他推开瞭望塔的门……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫就像最初那样，⟪k:4⟫他在前方引路——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C1DB5E46_FA01_4DD6_8F5E_004447434A7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84ff48a01f8af404b8f0da33b4351920b6d82c965b7a1e14893c1362006032aa
