msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sum of everything I did these three days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的行动……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CB3C7978_9C00_4437_A359_E6D28E83A517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab54d1fee265cb09b4e8de7e2668357cd2c552acf85811835230ac36e5fe4be3
