msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ultimately, I’m the one responsible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so the two of you are welcome to "
"stay behind..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……主谋是我。⟪k:3⟫你们可以留在这里……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c848ed1124df4b7af3dfc5cc31e30dc899c85088ff1d64295958409b3bdd355
#. default-sha256: 0bdd8737b33b6f563be5b38d8c322a7f60747d6db3271d0b4f1f822a9c3614c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m coming with you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A girl died because of the things I did...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I can’t just pretend it didn’t have anything to do with me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我也……⟪k:3⟫一起去……⟪k:4⟫我杀了一个女孩子……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫已经无法再装作视而不见的样子"
"了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0706580fe86717bc8e00b50c1c5b34262887a31e3406f061e64ca14979dbf85
