msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I never had any intention of fleeing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You may have been the one running "
"the operation,⟪k:5⟫but I did just as many terrible things as you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我早就做好了觉悟。⟪k:3⟫就算主谋是你，⟪k:4⟫我的所作所为也是不可原谅的……"

