msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D96F361C_877C_4409_8093_134A7AFA2081
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79195efeb1be2ebcc68077b3a1740cc9f3b4ac074f558f88affe9c5e00415f4c
