msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figure this is probably my last chance to say it,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so... ⟪k:5⟫thank you "
"for convincing me to hand over my key."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只有现在，⟪k:3⟫我才能说出口。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……谢谢你从我这里拿走钥匙……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FF87DF36_1317_4F06_B292_9C10C06315C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54cceeb8fda51bb0d8bb66f5994b0fb2020bed121e8ed10c456a10932ba5027e
