msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You always had the courage within you, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You simply needed a "
"little help finding it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我认为……⟪k:4⟫那份勇气是你原有的东西。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫你只是没有迈出那一步……⟪k:7⟫移开"
"了视线——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d750062a570234415b7439224c49ff9e49dd31453657427d626dd2b5952ad11
